Here is a user friendly interface to the date utility, for
setting the date and time.  It recognizes dates and times
in any of several formats.  For example:

	January 18,1983  18:45
	Jan 18, 1983 18:45:00
	jan 18, 1983 6:45 PM
	18:43  18-Jan-83
	1/18/83
	18:43
	8 AM

Users on V7 type systems will need to define "OLDFORMAT" when
compiling.

-Fred

